{"id":"vol8-04","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-04/audio-2.m4a","model":"small","duration":352.27,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":7.4,"text":"Section 2. You will hear a local counsellor giving advice on the radio about cleaning up after","words":[["Section",0.0,0.36],["2.",0.36,0.92],["You",1.8,2.26],["will",2.26,2.44],["hear",2.44,2.68],["a",2.68,2.86],["local",2.86,3.12],["counsellor",3.12,3.9],["giving",3.9,4.2],["advice",4.2,4.74],["on",4.74,5.02],["the",5.02,5.14],["radio",5.14,5.58],["about",5.58,6.06],["cleaning",6.06,6.56],["up",6.56,6.98],["after",6.98,7.4]]},{"start":7.4,"end":61.51,"text":"recent bad weather. First you have some time to look at questions 11-16 on page 3. Now listen","words":[["recent",7.4,7.84],["bad",7.84,8.34],["weather.",8.34,8.8],["First",9.74,10.46],["you",10.46,10.68],["have",10.68,10.82],["some",10.82,11.0],["time",11.0,11.38],["to",11.38,11.66],["look",11.66,11.78],["at",11.78,11.9],["questions",11.9,12.2],["11",12.2,12.74],["-16",12.74,13.52],["on",13.52,14.5],["page",14.5,14.82],["3.",14.82,15.3],["Now",60.85,61.17],["listen",61.17,61.51]]},{"start":61.51,"end":71.24,"text":"carefully and answer questions 11-16. Welcome to Radio OK, your community radio station.","words":[["carefully",61.51,62.03],["and",62.03,62.39],["answer",62.39,62.79],["questions",62.79,63.17],["11",63.17,63.83],["-16.",63.83,64.69],["Welcome",68.02,68.64],["to",68.64,68.92],["Radio",68.92,69.26],["OK,",69.26,69.68],["your",69.92,70.0],["community",70.0,70.34],["radio",70.34,70.7],["station.",70.7,71.24]]},{"start":71.86,"end":76.16,"text":"After our recent bad storm we have counsellor Phil Evans joining us to tell us about the","words":[["After",71.86,72.14],["our",72.14,72.34],["recent",72.34,72.66],["bad",72.66,73.04],["storm",73.04,73.46],["we",73.46,73.7],["have",73.7,73.82],["counsellor",73.82,74.38],["Phil",74.38,74.46],["Evans",74.46,74.72],["joining",74.72,75.08],["us",75.08,75.38],["to",75.38,75.54],["tell",75.54,75.7],["us",75.7,75.82],["about",75.82,76.0],["the",76.0,76.16]]},{"start":76.16,"end":77.84,"text":"cleanup effort. Welcome, Phil.","words":[["cleanup",76.16,76.44],["effort.",76.44,76.7],["Welcome,",77.2,77.5],["Phil.",77.74,77.84]]},{"start":78.28,"end":79.56,"text":"Hello, thanks for having me.","words":[["Hello,",78.28,78.5],["thanks",78.82,79.04],["for",79.04,79.22],["having",79.22,79.38],["me.",79.38,79.56]]},{"start":80.2,"end":82.38,"text":"Well, we had some pretty severe weather at the weekend.","words":[["Well,",80.2,80.46],["we",80.52,80.64],["had",80.64,80.82],["some",80.82,81.0],["pretty",81.0,81.26],["severe",81.26,81.58],["weather",81.58,81.82],["at",81.82,82.0],["the",82.0,82.08],["weekend.",82.08,82.38]]},{"start":82.86,"end":85.46,"text":"Thankfully, it wasn't quite as bad as last year's storm.","words":[["Thankfully,",82.86,83.22],["it",83.4,83.54],["wasn't",83.54,83.8],["quite",83.8,84.06],["as",84.06,84.24],["bad",84.24,84.42],["as",84.42,84.58],["last",84.58,84.86],["year's",84.86,85.28],["storm.",85.28,85.46]]},{"start":85.94,"end":87.52,"text":"Although there was some damage to trees,","words":[["Although",85.94,86.18],["there",86.18,86.34],["was",86.34,86.46],["some",86.46,86.74],["damage",86.74,86.96],["to",86.96,87.2],["trees,",87.2,87.52]]},{"start":87.74,"end":90.3,"text":"it was definitely not on the same scale as last year.","words":[["it",87.74,87.78],["was",87.78,87.9],["definitely",87.9,88.26],["not",88.26,88.6],["on",88.6,88.88],["the",88.88,88.96],["same",88.96,89.2],["scale",89.2,89.54],["as",89.54,89.72],["last",89.72,89.94],["year.",89.94,90.3]]},{"start":90.52,"end":92.84,"text":"And we were expecting the river level to rise higher","words":[["And",90.52,90.8],["we",90.8,90.92],["were",90.92,91.04],["expecting",91.04,91.44],["the",91.44,91.68],["river",91.68,91.82],["level",91.82,92.06],["to",92.06,92.26],["rise",92.26,92.5],["higher",92.5,92.84]]},{"start":92.84,"end":93.32,"text":"than it did.","words":[["than",92.84,93.0],["it",93.0,93.14],["did.",93.14,93.32]]},{"start":93.9,"end":96.36,"text":"But having said that, a much larger number of homes","words":[["But",93.9,94.14],["having",94.14,94.36],["said",94.36,94.64],["that,",94.64,94.84],["a",95.0,95.06],["much",95.06,95.2],["larger",95.2,95.6],["number",95.6,95.84],["of",95.84,96.0],["homes",96.0,96.36]]},{"start":96.36,"end":98.64,"text":"have been damaged this year due to flash flooding","words":[["have",96.36,96.62],["been",96.62,96.84],["damaged",96.84,97.24],["this",97.24,97.48],["year",97.48,97.74],["due",97.74,97.92],["to",97.92,98.08],["flash",98.08,98.28],["flooding",98.28,98.64]]},{"start":98.64,"end":99.28,"text":"near the creek.","words":[["near",98.64,98.92],["the",98.92,99.06],["creek.",99.06,99.28]]},{"start":100.12,"end":101.86,"text":"Those of you who have experienced flooding,","words":[["Those",100.12,100.46],["of",100.46,100.62],["you",100.62,100.72],["who",100.72,100.9],["have",100.9,101.0],["experienced",101.0,101.44],["flooding,",101.44,101.86]]},{"start":102.12,"end":104.04,"text":"we ask you to be especially careful.","words":[["we",102.12,102.32],["ask",102.32,102.66],["you",102.66,102.8],["to",102.8,102.9],["be",102.9,103.04],["especially",103.04,103.5],["careful.",103.5,104.04]]},{"start":104.04,"end":108.68,"text":"I know it's upsetting to see your home full of water, but please be patient as there's","words":[["I",104.04,104.54],["know",104.54,104.72],["it's",104.72,104.94],["upsetting",104.94,105.24],["to",105.24,105.52],["see",105.52,105.68],["your",105.68,105.84],["home",105.84,106.1],["full",106.1,106.32],["of",106.32,106.44],["water,",106.44,106.7],["but",107.0,107.2],["please",107.2,107.54],["be",107.54,107.78],["patient",107.78,108.2],["as",108.2,108.48],["there's",108.48,108.68]]},{"start":108.68,"end":112.54,"text":"nothing you can do until the river level drops, hopefully in two or three days.","words":[["nothing",108.68,108.9],["you",108.9,109.12],["can",109.12,109.26],["do",109.26,109.46],["until",109.46,109.74],["the",109.74,109.92],["river",109.92,110.12],["level",110.12,110.38],["drops,",110.38,110.78],["hopefully",110.94,111.42],["in",111.42,111.64],["two",111.64,111.82],["or",111.82,111.94],["three",111.94,112.14],["days.",112.14,112.54]]},{"start":113.44,"end":117.4,"text":"You won't have any electricity at the moment, but we are working as fast as we can to","words":[["You",113.44,113.6],["won't",113.6,113.76],["have",113.76,113.9],["any",113.9,114.08],["electricity",114.08,114.58],["at",114.58,114.76],["the",114.76,114.82],["moment,",114.82,115.1],["but",115.1,115.46],["we",115.46,115.6],["are",115.6,115.72],["working",115.72,116.02],["as",116.02,116.22],["fast",116.22,116.56],["as",116.56,116.8],["we",116.8,116.94],["can",116.94,117.22],["to",117.22,117.4]]},{"start":117.4,"end":118.36,"text":"get it reconnected.","words":[["get",117.4,117.56],["it",117.56,117.66],["reconnected.",117.66,118.36]]},{"start":119.14,"end":123.22,"text":"When it comes to cleaning up your garden, you might be tempted to just throw dead","words":[["When",119.14,119.44],["it",119.44,119.56],["comes",119.56,119.78],["to",119.78,119.96],["cleaning",119.96,120.18],["up",120.18,120.42],["your",120.42,120.52],["garden,",120.52,120.88],["you",121.26,121.42],["might",121.42,121.66],["be",121.66,121.86],["tempted",121.86,122.14],["to",122.14,122.4],["just",122.4,122.56],["throw",122.56,122.96],["dead",122.96,123.22]]},{"start":123.22,"end":125.62,"text":"branches and so on into your normal garbage bin.","words":[["branches",123.22,123.7],["and",123.7,123.9],["so",123.9,124.12],["on",124.12,124.24],["into",124.24,124.46],["your",124.46,124.64],["normal",124.64,124.86],["garbage",124.86,125.3],["bin.",125.3,125.62]]},{"start":126.02,"end":126.76,"text":"Please don't.","words":[["Please",126.02,126.38],["don't.",126.38,126.76]]},{"start":127.1,"end":131.32,"text":"We're asking people to simply stack them outside on the footpath ready for council","words":[["We're",127.1,127.32],["asking",127.32,127.58],["people",127.58,127.96],["to",127.96,128.14],["simply",128.14,128.44],["stack",128.44,128.7],["them",128.7,128.92],["outside",128.92,129.36],["on",129.36,129.7],["the",129.7,129.84],["footpath",129.84,130.4],["ready",130.4,130.82],["for",130.82,130.98],["council",130.98,131.32]]},{"start":131.32,"end":131.74,"text":"collection.","words":[["collection.",131.32,131.74]]},{"start":131.74,"end":135.0,"text":"We plan to cut them up and use them for composting.","words":[["We",131.74,132.6],["plan",132.6,132.84],["to",132.84,132.98],["cut",132.98,133.18],["them",133.18,133.32],["up",133.32,133.48],["and",133.48,133.88],["use",133.88,134.08],["them",134.08,134.22],["for",134.22,134.38],["composting.",134.38,135.0]]},{"start":135.84,"end":140.72,"text":"For those of you who don't have cooking facilities at the moment, I'm afraid we won't be able","words":[["For",135.84,136.32],["those",136.32,136.52],["of",136.52,136.68],["you",136.68,136.82],["who",136.82,137.16],["don't",137.16,137.48],["have",137.48,137.66],["cooking",137.66,137.94],["facilities",137.94,138.36],["at",138.36,138.64],["the",138.64,138.72],["moment,",138.72,139.0],["I'm",139.4,139.58],["afraid",139.58,139.84],["we",139.84,140.06],["won't",140.06,140.36],["be",140.36,140.48],["able",140.48,140.72]]},{"start":140.72,"end":144.26,"text":"to deliver hot meals to your home like the community centre did last year.","words":[["to",140.72,140.86],["deliver",140.86,141.1],["hot",141.1,141.42],["meals",141.42,141.64],["to",141.64,141.86],["your",141.86,141.96],["home",141.96,142.26],["like",142.26,142.44],["the",142.44,142.6],["community",142.6,142.9],["centre",142.9,143.26],["did",143.26,143.54],["last",143.54,143.84],["year.",143.84,144.26]]},{"start":144.76,"end":149.06,"text":"Instead, we'll be issuing vouchers that you can use to get food from any of the nominated","words":[["Instead,",144.76,145.16],["we'll",145.36,145.62],["be",145.62,145.74],["issuing",145.74,146.06],["vouchers",146.06,146.68],["that",146.68,146.98],["you",146.98,147.1],["can",147.1,147.28],["use",147.28,147.44],["to",147.44,147.58],["get",147.58,147.72],["food",147.72,148.0],["from",148.0,148.2],["any",148.2,148.48],["of",148.48,148.6],["the",148.6,148.7],["nominated",148.7,149.06]]},{"start":149.06,"end":149.62,"text":"restaurants.","words":[["restaurants.",149.06,149.62]]},{"start":150.28,"end":152.16,"text":"Just come to the council office to collect them.","words":[["Just",150.28,150.54],["come",150.54,150.74],["to",150.74,150.86],["the",150.86,151.0],["council",151.0,151.22],["office",151.22,151.52],["to",151.52,151.7],["collect",151.7,151.92],["them.",151.92,152.16]]},{"start":153.32,"end":156.46,"text":"We've had an overwhelming number of people offering to help out.","words":[["We've",153.32,153.56],["had",153.56,153.74],["an",153.74,153.88],["overwhelming",153.88,154.46],["number",154.46,154.96],["of",154.96,155.12],["people",155.12,155.38],["offering",155.38,155.8],["to",155.8,156.0],["help",156.0,156.2],["out.",156.2,156.46]]},{"start":156.46,"end":162.16,"text":"Anyone who would like to volunteer, please don't call the council office directly, instead,","words":[["Anyone",156.46,157.34],["who",157.34,157.66],["would",157.66,157.76],["like",157.76,158.0],["to",158.0,158.16],["volunteer,",158.16,158.64],["please",159.0,159.26],["don't",159.26,159.6],["call",159.6,159.84],["the",159.84,160.0],["council",160.0,160.28],["office",160.28,160.6],["directly,",160.6,161.04],["instead,",161.72,162.16]]},{"start":162.64,"end":167.12,"text":"if you're available to help clean up, just turn up at the community centre by 8am tomorrow","words":[["if",162.64,162.82],["you're",162.82,162.96],["available",162.96,163.26],["to",163.26,163.52],["help",163.52,163.7],["clean",163.7,163.98],["up,",163.98,164.22],["just",164.58,164.68],["turn",164.68,164.96],["up",164.96,165.14],["at",165.14,165.24],["the",165.24,165.32],["community",165.32,165.56],["centre",165.56,166.0],["by",166.0,166.22],["8am",166.22,166.7],["tomorrow",166.7,167.12]]},{"start":167.12,"end":171.88,"text":"and you'll be given the necessary tools and assigned a task by the council work supervisor.","words":[["and",167.12,167.6],["you'll",167.6,167.76],["be",167.76,167.88],["given",167.88,168.12],["the",168.12,168.3],["necessary",168.3,168.62],["tools",168.62,169.14],["and",169.14,169.54],["assigned",169.54,169.86],["a",169.86,170.0],["task",170.0,170.36],["by",170.36,170.56],["the",170.56,170.66],["council",170.66,171.0],["work",171.0,171.34],["supervisor.",171.34,171.88]]},{"start":172.98,"end":177.86,"text":"As the water level goes down, we may discover more problems. We'll be assessing the drinking","words":[["As",172.98,173.26],["the",173.26,173.42],["water",173.42,173.54],["level",173.54,173.78],["goes",173.78,174.1],["down,",174.1,174.38],["we",174.72,174.82],["may",174.82,175.02],["discover",175.02,175.44],["more",175.44,175.72],["problems.",175.72,176.18],["We'll",176.82,177.02],["be",177.02,177.12],["assessing",177.12,177.44],["the",177.44,177.64],["drinking",177.64,177.86]]},{"start":177.86,"end":183.1,"text":"water regularly so that there's no risk of contamination. Just be aware that local","words":[["water",177.86,178.22],["regularly",178.22,178.72],["so",178.72,179.22],["that",179.22,179.36],["there's",179.36,179.52],["no",179.52,179.72],["risk",179.72,180.02],["of",180.02,180.18],["contamination.",180.18,180.66],["Just",181.48,181.82],["be",181.82,182.04],["aware",182.04,182.36],["that",182.36,182.76],["local",182.76,183.1]]},{"start":183.1,"end":188.48,"text":"wildlife can be forced out of their natural habitat in this weather. Let the council know of any","words":[["wildlife",183.1,183.66],["can",183.66,184.08],["be",184.08,184.3],["forced",184.3,184.58],["out",184.58,184.82],["of",184.82,184.94],["their",184.94,185.08],["natural",185.08,185.4],["habitat",185.4,185.86],["in",185.86,186.06],["this",186.06,186.18],["weather.",186.18,186.42],["Let",187.3,187.48],["the",187.48,187.6],["council",187.6,187.88],["know",187.88,188.14],["of",188.14,188.26],["any",188.26,188.48]]},{"start":188.48,"end":194.56,"text":"unusual sightings so we can safely relocate them. It may seem that mosquitoes are around in abundance","words":[["unusual",188.48,188.86],["sightings",188.86,189.54],["so",189.54,189.94],["we",189.94,190.06],["can",190.06,190.22],["safely",190.22,190.62],["relocate",190.62,191.3],["them.",191.3,191.46],["It",192.2,192.36],["may",192.36,192.52],["seem",192.52,192.9],["that",192.9,193.06],["mosquitoes",193.06,193.38],["are",193.38,193.84],["around",193.84,194.12],["in",194.12,194.24],["abundance",194.24,194.56]]},{"start":194.56,"end":203.57,"text":"right now, but the actual population is usual for this time of year. Before you hear the rest of","words":[["right",194.56,194.92],["now,",194.92,195.24],["but",195.4,195.6],["the",195.6,195.72],["actual",195.72,196.04],["population",196.04,196.74],["is",196.74,197.22],["usual",197.22,197.68],["for",197.68,197.86],["this",197.86,198.02],["time",198.02,198.3],["of",198.3,198.42],["year.",198.42,198.66],["Before",201.91,202.41],["you",202.41,202.67],["hear",202.67,202.97],["the",202.97,203.17],["rest",203.17,203.43],["of",203.43,203.57]]},{"start":203.57,"end":231.78,"text":"the talk, you have some time to look at questions 17 to 20 on page 4. Now listen and answer questions","words":[["the",203.57,203.67],["talk,",203.67,204.01],["you",204.51,204.73],["have",204.73,204.91],["some",204.91,205.11],["time",205.11,205.49],["to",205.49,205.75],["look",205.75,205.91],["at",205.91,206.05],["questions",206.05,206.35],["17",206.35,207.27],["to",207.27,207.61],["20",207.61,208.09],["on",208.09,208.77],["page",208.77,209.09],["4.",209.09,209.57],["Now",229.9,230.2],["listen",230.2,230.56],["and",230.56,230.98],["answer",230.98,231.42],["questions",231.42,231.78]]},{"start":231.78,"end":241.08,"text":"17-20. Now I'll give you some information about key areas in the town. The school","words":[["17",231.78,232.42],["-20.",232.42,233.34],["Now",236.66,237.1],["I'll",237.1,237.24],["give",237.24,237.38],["you",237.38,237.48],["some",237.48,237.62],["information",237.62,238.1],["about",238.1,238.7],["key",238.7,239.08],["areas",239.08,239.42],["in",239.42,239.6],["the",239.6,239.7],["town.",239.7,240.0],["The",240.62,240.82],["school",240.82,241.08]]},{"start":241.08,"end":245.16,"text":"escaped any real problems and will be using its car park and some of the","words":[["escaped",241.08,241.32],["any",241.32,241.8],["real",241.8,242.12],["problems",242.12,242.64],["and",242.64,243.06],["will",243.06,243.16],["be",243.16,243.3],["using",243.3,243.52],["its",243.52,243.7],["car",243.7,244.02],["park",244.02,244.36],["and",244.36,244.78],["some",244.78,244.96],["of",244.96,245.06],["the",245.06,245.16]]},{"start":245.16,"end":249.56,"text":"classrooms to coordinate the cleanup. Because of that, the principal is asking","words":[["classrooms",245.16,245.56],["to",245.56,245.88],["coordinate",245.88,246.24],["the",246.24,246.48],["cleanup.",246.48,246.84],["Because",247.46,247.8],["of",247.8,247.98],["that,",247.98,248.16],["the",248.5,248.64],["principal",248.64,248.94],["is",248.94,249.18],["asking",249.18,249.56]]},{"start":249.56,"end":253.52,"text":"for volunteers to assist in getting the classrooms set back up again, with the","words":[["for",249.56,249.78],["volunteers",249.78,250.26],["to",250.26,250.56],["assist",250.56,250.88],["in",250.88,251.06],["getting",251.06,251.22],["the",251.22,251.44],["classrooms",251.44,251.88],["set",251.88,252.2],["back",252.2,252.4],["up",252.4,252.58],["again,",252.58,252.86],["with",253.2,253.36],["the",253.36,253.52]]},{"start":253.52,"end":257.2,"text":"desks back in their proper places before the new term begins after the","words":[["desks",253.52,253.84],["back",253.84,254.08],["in",254.08,254.22],["their",254.22,254.36],["proper",254.36,254.58],["places",254.58,255.02],["before",255.02,255.56],["the",255.56,255.78],["new",255.78,256.04],["term",256.04,256.3],["begins",256.3,256.68],["after",256.68,257.08],["the",257.08,257.2]]},{"start":257.2,"end":262.08,"text":"holidays. The hospital is still fully functional and the only damage there","words":[["holidays.",257.2,257.6],["The",258.36,258.64],["hospital",258.64,258.9],["is",258.9,259.26],["still",259.26,259.58],["fully",259.58,259.92],["functional",259.92,260.36],["and",260.36,260.98],["the",260.98,261.1],["only",261.1,261.36],["damage",261.36,261.74],["there",261.74,262.08]]},{"start":262.08,"end":265.16,"text":"which to the canteen were a tree branch broker window.","words":[["which",262.08,262.46],["to",262.46,262.6],["the",262.6,262.72],["canteen",262.72,263.32],["were",263.32,263.82],["a",263.82,263.96],["tree",263.96,264.14],["branch",264.14,264.48],["broker",264.48,264.8],["window.",264.8,265.16]]},{"start":265.76,"end":267.92,"text":"You can still access the area as normal.","words":[["You",265.76,266.2],["can",266.2,266.32],["still",266.32,266.54],["access",266.54,266.92],["the",266.92,267.16],["area",267.16,267.38],["as",267.38,267.64],["normal.",267.64,267.92]]},{"start":268.3,"end":270.74,"text":"We just ask you park at the rear of the hospital","words":[["We",268.3,268.42],["just",268.42,268.62],["ask",268.62,269.06],["you",269.06,269.3],["park",269.3,269.6],["at",269.6,269.78],["the",269.78,269.86],["rear",269.86,270.12],["of",270.12,270.26],["the",270.26,270.38],["hospital",270.38,270.74]]},{"start":270.74,"end":272.9,"text":"until the repair work has been completed.","words":[["until",270.74,271.24],["the",271.24,271.44],["repair",271.44,271.66],["work",271.66,272.1],["has",272.1,272.24],["been",272.24,272.42],["completed.",272.42,272.9]]},{"start":274.1,"end":275.62,"text":"If you need to get to the shops,","words":[["If",274.1,274.58],["you",274.58,274.7],["need",274.7,274.84],["to",274.84,274.98],["get",274.98,275.1],["to",275.1,275.26],["the",275.26,275.32],["shops,",275.32,275.62]]},{"start":276.08,"end":277.94,"text":"the high street is still a little flooded","words":[["the",276.08,276.18],["high",276.18,276.4],["street",276.4,276.64],["is",276.64,276.92],["still",276.92,277.22],["a",277.22,277.4],["little",277.4,277.56],["flooded",277.56,277.94]]},{"start":277.94,"end":281.32,"text":"so I'm afraid you'll have to collect your shopping on foot for a little while.","words":[["so",277.94,278.26],["I'm",278.26,278.48],["afraid",278.48,278.78],["you'll",278.78,279.08],["have",279.08,279.26],["to",279.26,279.4],["collect",279.4,279.66],["your",279.66,279.82],["shopping",279.82,280.08],["on",280.08,280.32],["foot",280.32,280.54],["for",280.54,280.76],["a",280.76,280.88],["little",280.88,280.98],["while.",280.98,281.32]]},{"start":281.62,"end":284.86,"text":"Hopefully, it won't be long before you'll be able to drive there again.","words":[["Hopefully,",281.62,282.08],["it",282.34,282.52],["won't",282.52,282.7],["be",282.7,282.84],["long",282.84,283.08],["before",283.08,283.36],["you'll",283.36,283.54],["be",283.54,283.66],["able",283.66,283.86],["to",283.86,284.02],["drive",284.02,284.3],["there",284.3,284.52],["again.",284.52,284.86]]},{"start":285.52,"end":288.26,"text":"Before the storm, we had hoped to begin work","words":[["Before",285.52,285.96],["the",285.96,286.24],["storm,",286.24,286.54],["we",286.86,287.02],["had",287.02,287.3],["hoped",287.3,287.58],["to",287.58,287.74],["begin",287.74,287.98],["work",287.98,288.26]]},{"start":288.26,"end":290.96,"text":"on modernizing the bikeway that runs along the river.","words":[["on",288.26,288.48],["modernizing",288.48,289.06],["the",289.06,289.26],["bikeway",289.26,289.8],["that",289.8,290.12],["runs",290.12,290.34],["along",290.34,290.58],["the",290.58,290.76],["river.",290.76,290.96]]},{"start":290.96,"end":295.28,"text":"We were particularly looking forward to having bike storage facilities installed.","words":[["We",290.96,291.6],["were",291.6,291.8],["particularly",291.8,292.32],["looking",292.32,292.66],["forward",292.66,293.04],["to",293.04,293.22],["having",293.22,293.44],["bike",293.44,293.74],["storage",293.74,294.16],["facilities",294.16,294.58],["installed.",294.58,295.28]]},{"start":296.08,"end":301.46,"text":"While the bikeway itself is okay, unfortunately the area around it is covered in water.","words":[["While",296.08,296.38],["the",296.38,296.54],["bikeway",296.54,296.98],["itself",296.98,297.28],["is",297.28,297.5],["okay,",297.5,297.88],["unfortunately",298.38,299.06],["the",299.06,299.44],["area",299.44,299.78],["around",299.78,300.26],["it",300.26,300.44],["is",300.44,300.66],["covered",300.66,300.98],["in",300.98,301.16],["water.",301.16,301.46]]},{"start":302.02,"end":307.9,"text":"So we've postponed our work there indefinitely and I'm afraid it's now unlikely that this will ever go ahead.","words":[["So",302.02,302.26],["we've",302.26,302.48],["postponed",302.48,302.88],["our",302.88,303.12],["work",303.12,303.34],["there",303.34,303.56],["indefinitely",303.56,304.2],["and",304.2,304.82],["I'm",304.82,305.04],["afraid",305.04,305.36],["it's",305.36,305.7],["now",305.7,305.86],["unlikely",305.86,306.34],["that",306.34,306.8],["this",306.8,307.0],["will",307.0,307.18],["ever",307.18,307.42],["go",307.42,307.62],["ahead.",307.62,307.9]]},{"start":308.7,"end":312.9,"text":"Well, that's everything for now. I'll be back with a further update tomorrow.","words":[["Well,",308.7,309.1],["that's",309.46,309.8],["everything",309.8,310.1],["for",310.1,310.32],["now.",310.32,310.5],["I'll",311.0,311.24],["be",311.24,311.32],["back",311.32,311.56],["with",311.56,311.72],["a",311.72,311.84],["further",311.84,312.1],["update",312.1,312.52],["tomorrow.",312.52,312.9]]},{"start":316.37,"end":321.73,"text":"That is the end of section 2. You now have half a minute to check your answers.","words":[["That",316.37,316.75],["is",316.75,316.89],["the",316.89,317.05],["end",317.05,317.39],["of",317.39,317.55],["section",317.55,317.81],["2.",317.81,318.33],["You",318.97,319.23],["now",319.23,319.49],["have"